
@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Danh sach san pham - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 2. San pham khong ton tai - 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 3. Chi tiet san pham - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. Tao san pham hop le - 201 Created
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
    "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
    "price": 80000
}

### 5. Tao san pham khong hop le - 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "San pham loi",
    "description": "",
    "price": -1
}
